# Pack-time requirements (checklist for every new ZIP)

## 1) `theme.json`

- [ ] `key`, `title`, `categorySlug`, `sectionVariants`, `homeSectionOrder`, `pages[]`, `previewImage`
- [ ] Every page: `id`, `label`, `sectionType`, full `sections[]` (Topbar→Header→…→Footer)
- [ ] Page ids stable & unique (`about`, `team`, `services`…) — not only pretty labels
- [ ] **`variables` complete** (primary/secondary/header/hero/fonts/link tokens) = preview brand
- [ ] If `pages` includes `home`, switcher code must not double-count Home (editor already dedupes; pack may omit home from pages or keep id `home` once)

## 2) Components TSX

- [ ] Default export + `editorFields` on component
- [ ] Own asset mapper file (`lib/<theme>Assets.ts`), not `restaurantFoodAssets`
- [ ] Brand colors → CSS vars (accent vs ink split)
- [ ] No `theme-upload-css-vars` fixed inject
- [ ] Header/Footer: logo media attrs + logoImage/image; CTAs string|object
- [ ] Links via `toLestowHref` / `#page-<id>`
- [ ] Nav urls align with `pages[].id`

## 3) `component.json`

- [ ] `editorFields` match painted fields
- [ ] `defaultContent` uses S3-safe paths after upload rewrite
- [ ] CTA fields match what TSX reads (string or object — document which)

## 4) Editor rails that must stay (do not regress)

| Area | Guard |
|------|--------|
| Theme Upload align | `alignThemeUploadTemplatePages` — full stack, strip foreign Breadcrumb/*Page/Custom scaffold |
| Breadcrumbs | `ensureMissingPageBreadcrumbs` skip + strip when theme crumb exists |
| Init injectors | Skip `addAboutPageSection` chain for Theme Upload ids |
| Custom scaffold | Skip if theme page exists; strip CustomPageDetail junk |
| Slugs | `normalizePageSlug` + `editorPageSlugsMatch` aliases |
| Switcher | Single Home; theme page order |
| Chrome visibility | One shell Topbar/Header/Footer per view |
| Theme vars | `getTemplateVariables` / family defaults; Reset default = pack palette |
| Logo media | `replaceHintedMediaValue` allows new `logoImage` + sync `image` |
| Registry | First-party Header/Footer overrides win over generated copies when patched |

## 5) Smoke test after upload (mandatory)

Editor: `/editor?templateId=<key>&category=<Category>&businessName=test`

1. Home: 1 Topbar, 1 Header, logo pencil, **both** CTAs, accents follow Theme Color Primary  
2. Reset default = compose/preview brand (not Ocean teal / not random Violet leftover)  
3. Theme Fonts: heading font on `h1–h6`  
4. About: one theme breadcrumb; no About Story  
5. Team (“Our Team”): one page only; no `our-team` ghost; no Practical next steps  
6. Multi Pages: one Home row; all pack pages open with correct `?page=`  
7. No stacked headers on any inner page  
8. Preview compose URL matches editor chrome/colors  

## 6) Code touchpoints (family add / packer)

- `apps/backend/src/theme-upload/theme-github-native.pack.ts` — map + hex→var rewrite + variables emit  
- `apps/backend/.../theme-upload.service.ts` — persist `variables` on create  
- Frontend: `isThemeUploadTemplateId`, `alignThemeUploadTemplatePages`, breadcrumb/custom strip, `getTemplateVariables`, `EditorThemePanels` Reset default  
- `lib/editorPageSlug.ts` — label aliases  
- `sectionRegistry` — first-party overrides  
- Compose: `lexoraPreview` / page aliases for path ↔ `#page-*`  

